Purpose: the Remote Settings dump generator only knows Firefox, Android, iOS and
Thunderbird/SeaMonkey applications and asserts otherwise; add swell/app, and place the
dumps in Swell's application directory (DIST_SUBDIR "app").
Test: MOZCONFIG=swell/mozconfig ./mach build completes the misc tier.
Upstreamable: no (names a downstream application); keep in the queue.

